      "key": "nrdb-ui-text.nrdb-ui-widget.yonder-fixed.yonder-pending.yonder-qualifier#1",
      "text": "There is nothing for you to confirm: the device keeps the change once it holds an address on the new network, and puts the previous configuration back by itself if it does not. Revert it now if you have decided against it."
